  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GBV RESPONSE MITIG&apos;N &amp; LIVELIHOOD RECOVERY/TIGRAY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to reduce suffering of crisis-affected individuals in Tigray and enhance their coping capacities through provision of high quality, survivor centred GBV response services. Outcome 1: will target health facilities, Women and Girls Safe Spaces and community structures to enable access to comprehensive GBV and MHPSS services; Outcome 2: will target female-headed households, women, and older adolescent girls for livelihood recovery; Outcome 3: will target health workers, mental health professionals and health institutions for strengthened capacity to provide quality GBV and MHPSS services</narrative>
  </description>
